@startuml
' newpage splits the diagram so each page fits landscape A4: PlantUML exports
' seq-create-delivery.png, seq-create-delivery_001.png, ... (one file per page).
title Sequence Diagram - Customer Creates a Delivery (1 of 5)
caption SwiftDrop parcel-service (Role 3)

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBorderColor black
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ActorBorderColor black
  ActorBackgroundColor white
  BoxBorderColor black
  BoxBackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  GroupBorderColor black
  GroupBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
  DividerBorderColor black
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}
skinparam queue {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}

actor Customer
participant "React SPA" as FE
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as GW
box "parcel-service :8083" #F2F2F2
  participant "CustomerParcel\nController" as CTRL
  participant "ParcelService" as SVC
  participant "PricingService\nClient" as PC
  participant "OutboxRelay" as RELAY
end box
participant "pricing-service\n:8082" as PR
database "parcel_db\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ\nparcel.events" as MQ

== 1. Fee estimate before confirming ==
Customer -> FE : Fill booking form (pickup and drop-off address and zone, recipient name and phone, size, weight in kg, speed, optional promo code)
FE -> GW : GET /api/v1/pricing/estimate\n?fromZone&toZone&weightKg\n&size&speed&promoCode
GW -> PR : forward
PR --> GW : 200 estimated fee and breakdown (LKR)
GW --> FE : 200 estimated fee
FE --> Customer : show estimated fee

newpage Sequence Diagram - Customer Creates a Delivery (2 of 5)
== 2. Confirm booking ==
Customer -> FE : Confirm
FE -> GW : POST /api/v1/parcels\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT, booking details)
GW -> GW : verify JWT signature\n(RS256, auth-service public key from JWKS)
GW -> CTRL : forward
CTRL -> CTRL : verify JWT again,\n@PreAuthorize CUSTOMER or ADMIN,\n@Valid CreateParcelRequest
alt missing / invalid token
  GW --> FE : 401 Unauthorized
else wrong role
  CTRL --> FE : 403 Forbidden (via GW)
else invalid fields
  CTRL --> FE : 400 ProblemDetail with field errors (via GW)
end
CTRL -> SVC : createCustomerParcel(\ncustomerId from JWT, request)

newpage Sequence Diagram - Customer Creates a Delivery (3 of 5)
== 3. Binding fee from pricing (the client's fee is never trusted) ==
SVC -> PC : getQuote(pickupZone, dropoffZone,\nweightKg, size, speed, promoCode)
PC -> PR : POST /internal/pricing/quote\nX-Internal-Token (InternalRestClientFactory)\n{pickupZone, dropoffZone, weightKg, size, speed, promoCode}\ndirect service-to-service call, not via gateway;\ntimeouts 2 s connect / 5 s read
alt valid quote
  PR --> PC : 200 {routeType, baseFee, weightFee, sizeFee,\nexpressFee, discount, total, currency: "LKR"}
  PC --> SVC : quote (total + breakdown)
else unknown or expired promo code, or weight does not fit size
  PR --> PC : 400 ProblemDetail
  PC --> FE : 400 validation error (via SVC, CTRL, GW)\nnothing saved
else pricing down, slow or unreachable
  PR --> PC : 5xx / timeout / connection refused
  PC --> FE : 503 Service Unavailable (via SVC, CTRL, GW)\nnothing saved, no fallback price
end

newpage Sequence Diagram - Customer Creates a Delivery (4 of 5)
== 4. Save in one transaction ==
SVC -> DB : generate tracking number SD-XXXX-XXXX\n(e.g. SD-7K3Q-9P2M) and check it is not\nalready used (regenerate if taken)
group One transaction (@Transactional)
  SVC -> DB : INSERT parcels\n(status = CREATED, fee_amount = quote total,\nplus the fee breakdown)
  SVC -> DB : INSERT parcel_status_history\n(CREATED, changed_by = customerId, role CUSTOMER,\nnote "Delivery booking created")
  SVC -> DB : INSERT outbox_events\n(ParcelStatusChanged v1, status PENDING,\nrouting key parcel.status.created)
  SVC -> DB : COMMIT
end
note over SVC, DB
  Saved together or not at all: the event is never lost and never
  sent for an unsaved parcel (transactional outbox pattern).
end note
SVC --> CTRL : created parcel
CTRL --> GW : 201 Created\nLocation: /api/v1/parcels/{id}\n{trackingNo, status, fee}
GW --> FE : 201 Created
FE --> Customer : show booking confirmation and tracking number

newpage Sequence Diagram - Customer Creates a Delivery (5 of 5)
== 5. Outbox relay publishes the event (asynchronous) ==
loop every 1 s, up to 50 events
  RELAY -> DB : SELECT oldest due PENDING event of each parcel\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  RELAY -> MQ : publish ParcelStatusChanged\n(routing key parcel.status.created, messageId = eventId)
  alt broker confirms (ack) and routes it
    MQ --> RELAY : ack
    RELAY -> DB : UPDATE status = SENT, sent_at = now
  else nack, unroutable, no confirm within 5 s, or broker down
    RELAY -> DB : retry_count + 1,\nnext_attempt_at = now + backoff (1 s, 2 s, 4 s ... max 60 s),\nlast_error
  end
end
note over RELAY, MQ
  Topic exchange fans out to notification.q,
  webhook.q, dispatch.q and tracking.q.
  The event carries IDs only: no names,
  phone numbers or addresses.
end note

@enduml
